--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PART A — SCOPE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 applies to the original work in this repository, which is the
StreamReady framework, the Answer Readiness Score, the ProReady-QA data pipeline
and the surrounding training/evaluation scaffolding:

    lavis/models/streamready/                 visual memory tree, query-aware
                                              retrieval, contextual memory bank,
                                              readiness mechanism
    lavis/models/blip2_models/streamready.py  the StreamReady model
    lavis/metrics/ars.py                      Answer Readiness Score
    lavis/metrics/answer_matching.py          answer scoring
    lavis/datasets/datasets/proready_qa_datasets.py
    lavis/datasets/datasets/streaming_qa_datasets.py
    lavis/datasets/datasets/frame_loading.py
    lavis/datasets/builders/proready_qa_builder.py
    lavis/datasets/builders/streaming_qa_builder.py
    lavis/tasks/readiness_vqa.py
    lavis/tasks/video_qa.py
    lavis/configs/datasets/**  lavis/configs/models/streamready/**
    lavis/projects/streamready/**
    data/extract_frames.py
    tools/**
    run_scripts/**
    train.py  evaluate.py  setup.py

